Additional Components

The following components were developed under the direction of Attect,
with implementation assistance from GLM5 AI:

1. CMake Build System
   - CMakeLists.txt and related build configuration files
   - Build scripts and compilation configurations
   - Project structure adaptations for CMake

2. Kotlin Implementation
   - Complete Kotlin/JVM port of the JavaScript engine
   - Parser, lexer, and runtime components
   - Memory management system
   - GraalVM Native Image support
   - All source files under the kotlin/ directory

These additional components are also licensed under the MIT License
as stated above.
